		(at 132.075 73.6 90)
		(descr "Texas Instruments RNM0015A VQFN, 15 terminals, 2.5x3 mm body, 1 mm max height; land pattern per drawing 4222000/B. Terminals 12/13 (VIN) and 7/8 (VOUT) are internally common and share one land, entered as coincident pads. Pads 7-13 are solder mask defined, mask opening 0.05 mm inside copper; pads 1-6, 14 and 15 are copper defined, mask opening 0.05 mm outside copper. Paste on pads 9, 10 and 11 follows the datasheet stencil: two apertures each, 85% coverage by area")
